WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.610
- Do you see anything wrong
with what your son did?

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:04.443
- So the Q-Shaman's mom

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:06.040
was apparently defending him on 60 Minutes

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.300
and it's a train wreck, let's watch.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.420
- What do you mean by wrong, like, wrong?

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.280
- Well, by wrong, it means illegal.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.130
- [Interviewer] Do you
see the gravity of it?

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.710
- I feel the gravity of it

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:21.160
because my son is in, he's
where he is right now.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.350
- He's in jail waiting to be prosecuted

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:24.570
for all the crimes that he committed.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.710
That's where he is.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.290
- If he could take it back, he would.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.413
- 'Cause it was illegal.

00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:32.130
- He walked through open doors.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:32.963
- He walked through open doors

00:00:32.963 --> 00:00:34.570
that he wasn't allowed to walk through.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.650
- My son was there,

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.940
but he wasn't a part
of the bad part of it.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:38.990
- Right.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:41.960
That's not a thing that is not
a legally defensible thing.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:46.960
I don't think it's right
that it was one fraudulently.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.450
Yeah, well that has nothing to do with

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:55.140
whether your son committed
multiple felonies.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.330
Spoiler alert, he did.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.653
So subscribe or I'll see you in court.

